  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Digital for Development Hub (D4D)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Netherlands, represented by the Netherlands Enterprise Agency, is a partner of the European platform Digital for Development hub (D4D). This platform focuses on strengthening a sustainable digital economy in low- and middle-income countries.The platform facilitates knowledge sharing and cooperation, and supports the development of digitalisation programmes through a Team Europe approach.</narrative>
  </description>
